# demo_stick_playingcard_forehead Specification

## Overview

`demo_stick_playingcard_forehead` demonstrates playing card detection with "stick" effect on forehead (fun demo effect).

## Usage

```bash
python demo_stick_playingcard_forehead.py [options]
```

## Arguments

| Argument | Type | Default | Description |
|----------|------|---------|-------------|
| `--device` | int | 0 | Camera device index |

## Features

- Face detection using MediaPipe
- Card overlay on forehead position
- Fun AR-style effect

## Exit

- Press ESC to quit
